1. What is SPARC?

SPARC is a processor (CPU) architecture made by Oracle.

Just as laptops use Intel or AMD processors, some Solaris servers use SPARC processors.

Solaris runs especially well on SPARC servers.

Note:-

Solaris Administration

It means managing Solaris servers.

Daily tasks:

Create users
Reset passwords
Check disk space
Restart services
Monitor CPU and memory
Apply patches

Exactly like Linux administration.
